---
// The AI endpoint habit versus the resource contract, side by side.
// The left panel is muted (the habit you inherit); the right panel is
// the red accent — the surface you choose and clients depend on.
const W = 900, H = 292;
const panels = [
  {
    x: 20, icon: 'robot', disc: false, red: false,
    title: { en: 'the generated habit', vi: 'thói quen của code AI' },
    rows: [
      { m: 'POST', p: '/api/getCases', c: '200' },
      { m: 'POST', p: '/api/createCase', c: '200' },
      { m: 'POST', p: '/api/updateCase', c: '200' },
      { m: 'POST', p: '/api/deleteCase', c: '200' },
    ],
    note: [
      { en: 'every call looks the same —', vi: 'call nào cũng giống nhau —' },
      { en: 'failures come back 200 too, hidden in the body', vi: 'lỗi cũng về 200, giấu trong body' },
    ],
  },
  {
    x: 480, icon: 'fastapi', disc: true, red: true,
    title: { en: 'the resource contract', vi: 'hợp đồng tài nguyên' },
    rows: [
      { m: 'GET', p: '/v1/cases', c: '200' },
      { m: 'POST', p: '/v1/cases', c: '201 + Location' },
      { m: 'PUT', p: '/v1/cases/13', c: '200' },
      { m: 'DELETE', p: '/v1/cases/13', c: '204' },
    ],
    note: [
      { en: 'the verb says the action,', vi: 'verb nói hành động,' },
      { en: 'the code says what happened', vi: 'code nói chuyện gì đã xảy ra' },
    ],
  },
];
---
<figure class="bep2b">
  <div class="bep2b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two endpoint sets side by side. Left, the generated habit: POST to getCases, createCase, updateCase and deleteCase, every answer 200. Right, the resource contract: GET, POST, PUT and DELETE on /v1/cases, answering 200, 201 with Location, 200 and 204.">
    {panels.map((p) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={p.x} y="16" width="400" height="256" rx="10" class={p.red ? 'panelr' : 'panel'} />
        {p.disc && <circle cx={p.x + 36} cy="44" r="19" class="disc" />}
        <image href={`/icons/flow/${p.icon}.svg`} x={p.x + 22} y="30" width="28" height="28" class="icn" aria-hidden="true" />
        <text x={p.x + 60} y="49" class={p.red ? 'tt r' : 'tt'}><tspan data-lang-en>{p.title.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.title.vi}</tspan></text>
        {p.rows.map((row, i) => (
          <g>
            <rect x={p.x + 16} y={66 + i * 42} width="368" height="32" rx="6" class="row" />
            <text x={p.x + 32} y={87 + i * 42} class="meth">{row.m}</text>
            <text x={p.x + 100} y={87 + i * 42} class="path">{row.p}</text>
            <text x={p.x + 368} y={87 + i * 42} text-anchor="end" class="code">{row.c}</text>
          </g>
        ))}
        <text x={p.x + 200} y="246" text-anchor="middle" class={p.red ? 'nt r' : 'nt'}><tspan data-lang-en>{p.note[0].en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.note[0].vi}</tspan></text>
        <text x={p.x + 200} y="264" text-anchor="middle" class={p.red ? 'nt r' : 'nt'}><tspan data-lang-en>{p.note[1].en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{p.note[1].vi}</tspan></text>
      </g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The same four operations, two surfaces. Left: one verb, one code — the wire carries no information, and a failure is indistinguishable from a success until you parse the body. Right: the verb is the action, the status code is the receipt.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cùng bốn thao tác, hai bề mặt. Trái: một verb, một mã — dây truyền chẳng mang thông tin gì, lỗi với thành công giống nhau tới khi bạn mổ body ra xem. Phải: verb là hành động, status code là biên lai.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep2b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep2b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep2b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep2b text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep2b .tt { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep2b .meth { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .bep2b .path { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .bep2b .code { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .bep2b .nt { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep2b .r { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep2b .row { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .bep2b .panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep2b .panelr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .bep2b .disc { fill: none; }
  .bep2b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  :global([data-theme='dark']) .bep2b .disc { fill: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88); }
</style>
